# =============================================================================
# Aionis .gitignore — anti-leakage quant research project.
# Golden rules: NEVER commit secrets (.env). NEVER commit data/ or *.parquet.
# =============================================================================

# --- Operating-frame dirs are TRACKED prose (do NOT ignore) ---
# state/ decisions/ tasks/ evals/ reports/ archive/ + CLAUDE.md + WORKFLOW.md + AGENTS.md
# hold markdown only — the durable cross-context handoff surface. Keep them tracked.
# Any new broad rule (*.json, *.md, etc.) below must not swallow these.

# --- Secrets (NEVER commit) ---
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.python-version

# --- Data (all of data/ is cached / snapshot / regenerable; anti-leakage default) ---
data/
# Tracked terminal data payloads — CI renders against these JSON files
# (anti-leakage: only aggregated outputs, never runs/ parquet or raw data).
!web/src/data/
*.parquet
*.tar.gz
*.cache.json

# --- Run artifacts (regenerable). The append-only ledger IS tracked. ---
runs/results/
runs/*.log
runs/*.json
runs/health_*.json
# Stray root-level operational logs (fetch/debug output) — regenerable, never tracked
/*.log

# --- Tooling caches / coverage ---
.benchmarks/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# --- Editors / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
.DS_Store

# --- OMC operational state (.omc/skills/** is the intentional committable exception) ---
.omc/

# --- Mimosa security-scan plugin runtime store (hook state, regenerable) ---
.mimosa/

# Next.js build output (stray root builds)
.next/
runs/xys-design/
# Visual-iteration capture artifacts (screenshots, edge profiles, fetched
# reference HTML/CSS) — regenerable display-lane QA evidence, never tracked.
runs/ui-iter/
runs/ui-audit-*/
